Package: iseeSpatial
Title: Interactive Exploration of Cell-Resolution Spatial Transcriptomics with iSEE
Version: 0.99.0
Authors@R:
    c(person("Emile", "Danvin", email = "emile.danvin@gmail.com",
             role = c("aut", "cre")),
      person("Dario", "Righelli", role = c("aut", "ths")))
Description: Extends the iSEE interface with panels for spatial
    transcriptomics at cellular resolution, from imaging-based (CosMx,
    Xenium) and sequencing-based (Visium HD, cell-segmented) platforms. A
    region selected on an overview map (fields of view or individual cells)
    is applied to every panel: spatial plots, quality-control histograms,
    spatial statistics (Moran's I, join-count, L-functions), spatially
    variable genes, cellular niches and spatial domains. Heavy computations
    run on demand on the selected region, and niches and domains can be
    precomputed offline on the whole dataset.
